"See the [README](https://github.com/AoT-inc/AoT#uses) for features, "
"projects using AoT, screenshots, and other information."
msgstr ""
"Zobacz [README](https://github.com/AoT-inc/AoT#uses), aby poznać funkcje,"
" projekty korzystające z AoT, zrzuty ekranu i inne informacje."

